# setuptools packs the top-level tests/test*.py into the sdist by default,
# without the conftest.py and the helpers they import, so an unpacked sdist
# could not collect them. The suite also reads scripts/, docs/ and .github/,
# so it stays in the repository. The wheel takes no file from here: its data
# files are the package-data globs of pyproject.toml alone.
prune tests
